storm,” and “liquidations” suggests the move was abrupt, crowded, and amplified by derivatives positioning. The more specific liquidation figures are especially important: $500 million liquidated in an hour in one report, $584 million across 24 hours in another, and $160 million across the network in one hour in a Bitget summary. That combination of short-window and 24-hour figures indicates sustained stress rather than a single isolated spike. The market narrative also links Bitcoin’s slide to macro headlines about Iran and U.S. policy, which likely intensified the risk-off response among traders. Even where the wording differs by source, the core event is the same: Bitcoin’s drop below $77,000 triggered a heavy liquidation wave and dragged the broader crypto market lower.\",\n  \"CHART_COIN\": \"bitcoin\"\n}[... 126605 more characters truncated]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779082565408},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"callS259SJQNhZ4i2DnfMzN7ornf","name":"process","arguments":{"action":"poll","sessionId":"quiet-summit","timeout":0}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":65252,"output":151,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65403,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779082565409,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dgkw5Z5uXMj6oN6ZhAE3b9QylSYW1"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callS259SJQNhZ4i2DnfMzN7ornf","toolName":"process","content":[{"type":"text","text":"e was not just a brief wick but part of a larger unwind. grafa.com’s “Crypto long liquidations reach $584M amid market drop” independently confirms the same aggregate liquidation scale. thedeepdive.ca’s “Crypto Market Takes Another Hit as Bitcoin Dips Below $77K in Monday Flash Crash” reinforces that this was a broader crypto market shock, not just a BTC-only event. A separate Bitget item says BTC fell below the 77,000 mark and that $160 million was liquidated acro