{"traceSchema":"openclaw-trajectory","schemaVersion":1,"traceId":"44726aef-8f54-4839-b9b8-a87a401d074c","source":"runtime","type":"prompt.submitted","ts":"2026-05-18T05:47:04.670Z","seq":4,"sourceSeq":4,"sessionId":"44726aef-8f54-4839-b9b8-a87a401d074c","sessionKey":"agent:orchestrator:telegram:direct:5691449303","runId":"exec-approval-followup:7b6ec432-df82-4d84-81e3-d9a978587185","workspaceDir":"/home/bhard/.openclaw/workspace-orchestrator","provider":"local-bifrost","modelId":"gpt-5.4","modelApi":"openai-completions","data":{"prompt":"[Mon 2026-05-18 05:47 UTC] An async command the user already approved has completed.\nDo not run the command again.\nIf the task requires more steps, continue from this result before replying to the user.\nOnly ask the user for help if you are actually blocked.\n\nExact completion details:\nExec finished (gateway id=7b6ec432-df82-4d84-81e3-d9a978587185, session=neat-shell, code 0)\nfor agent reply…[1G[J◒ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◐ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◓ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◑ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◒ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◐ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◓ Waiting for agent reply…[1G[J◑ Waiting for agent reply….[1G[J◒ Waiting for agent reply….[1G[J◐ Waiting for agent reply….[1G[J◓ Waiting for agent reply….[1G[J◑ Waiting for agent r\n\nContinue the task if needed, then reply to the user in a helpful way.\nIf it succeeded, share the relevant output.\nIf it failed, explain what went wrong.","systemPrompt":"You are a personal assistant running inside OpenClaw.\n## Tooling\nTool availability (filtered by policy):\nTool names are case-sensitive. Call tools exactly as listed.\n- read: Read file contents\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n- edit: Make precise edits to files\n- exec: Run shell commands (pty available for TTY-required CLIs)\n- process: Manage background exec sessions\n- web_search: Search the web (Brave API)\n- web_fetch: Fetch and extract readable content from a URL\n- browser: Control web br