gs getting squeezed as external risk headlines and broad selling pressure fed into each other. The repeated use of phrases like ‘flash crash,’ ‘sell-off,’ ‘macro storm,’ and ‘liquidations’ suggests the move was abrupt, crowded, and amplified by derivatives positioning. The more specific liquidation figures are especially important: $500 million liquidated in an hour in one report, $584 million across 24 hours in another, and $160 million across the network in one hour in a Bitget summary. That combination of short-window and 24-hour figures indicates sustained stress rather than a single isolated spike. The market narrative also links Bitcoin’s slide to macro headlines about Iran and U.S. policy, which likely intensified the risk-off response among traders. Even where the wording differs by source, the core event is the same: Bitcoin’s drop below $77,000 triggered a heavy liquidation wave and dragged the broader crypto market lower.\",\n  \"CHART_COIN\": \"bitcoin\"\n}\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779083020946},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callfE1XLcKEHJwjUlGLppAXjXu0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\u001b[?25l│\n\n[Showing lines 1-1 of 2 (50.0KB limit). Use offset=2 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1779083020946},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"callX2O8lJwX6PZAE3QRkShEQ0Hw","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/tmp/crypto-article.md","offset":1,"limit":120}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":40486,"output":226,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":40712,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779083020948,"responseId":"chatcmpl-Dgl3QIYAnK5NF2GgPxJRDtToczAQ2"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"callX2O8lJwX6PZAE3QRkShEQ0Hw","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\u001b[?25l│\n\n[Showing lines 1-1 of 2 (50.0KB limit). Use offset=2 to continue.]"}],"isError":false,"